WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.043
Coby: What's wrong, Jenna?

2
00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:09.764
Daisy: She's sad.

3
00:00:09.765 --> 00:00:13.056
School's almost over.

4
00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:17.069
Jenna: It's almost summer.

5
00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.854
Coby: Are you kidding me?

6
00:00:19.855 --> 00:00:24.617
Coby: Summer is the best part of the year! Right, Mark?

7
00:00:24.618 --> 00:00:29.843
Mark: Umm . . . Not this year, Coby.

8
00:00:29.844 --> 00:00:32.150
Coby: What do you mean?

9
00:00:32.151 --> 00:00:35.820
Mark: Room Two. Miss Gray.

10
00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:39.943
It's just about over. Forever.

11
00:00:39.944 --> 00:00:46.058
Jenna: Boohoo! Don't remind me!

12
00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:50.012
Miss Gray: Good morning, boys and girls!

13
00:00:50.013 --> 00:00:52.353
Please come to the rug.

14
00:00:52.354 --> 00:00:59.941
Miss Gray: I have lots of news to share.

15
00:00:59.942 --> 00:01:03.357
Coby: Are we doing something fun?

16
00:01:03.358 --> 00:01:08.371
Miss Gray: We're always doing something fun in Room Two, Coby.

17
00:01:08.372 --> 00:01:10.779
Miss Gray: Because learning is . . .

18
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:14.240
Kids: Fun! Fun! Fun!

19
00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:17.890
Miss Gray: Now, as you know, school is almost over.

20
00:01:17.891 --> 00:01:21.644
Miss Gray: So we're going to play some fun games this week.

21
00:01:21.645 --> 00:01:25.539
Miss Gray: But I want you to do something special for me.

22
00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:26.870
Jenna: Anything, Miss Gray.

23
00:01:26.871 --> 00:01:29.241
We'll do anything for you!

24
00:01:29.242 --> 00:01:31.084
Miss Gray: Thank you, Jenna.

25
00:01:31.085 --> 00:01:33.872
I'd like you to write some letters.

26
00:01:33.873 --> 00:01:37.597
Mark: Letters? To who?

27
00:01:37.598 --> 00:01:41.235
Miss Gray: To the kids who will be in my class next year.

28
00:01:41.236 --> 00:01:44.767
Miss Gray: I want you to tell them all about Room Two.

29
00:01:44.768 --> 00:01:47.466
Daisy: We can tell them about Career Day!

30
00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:49.958
Mark: And helping Jim!

31
00:01:49.959 --> 00:01:52.315
Coby: Don't forget Silly Hair Day!

32
00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:55.786
Miss Gray: We've had so much fun together.

33
00:01:55.787 --> 00:01:57.518
Miss Gray: Okay, boys and girls.

34
00:01:57.519 --> 00:02:04.819
Let the games begin!

35
00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.270
Coby: Woo-hoo! Tug-of-war!

36
00:02:08.271 --> 00:02:14.540
Mark: And it's going to be an easy win!

37
00:02:14.541 --> 00:02:23.234
Mark: Boys against girls!

